<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/10th-century">10th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">939 CE</h1><p class="ref-lede">939 CE in world history: 7 events, 1 birth, 2 deaths and 2 states founded. 369 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
<nav class="ref-letters yr-near" aria-label="Nearby years"><a href="/years/935">935 CE</a><a href="/years/936">936 CE</a><a href="/years/937">937 CE</a><a href="/years/938">938 CE</a><a href="/years/939" aria-current="page">939 CE</a><a href="/years/942">942 CE</a><a href="/years/945">945 CE</a><a href="/years/946">946 CE</a><a href="/years/947">947 CE</a></nav>
<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-simancas" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-simancas.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/july-19">19 July</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Ramiro II of León defeats Abd al-Rahman III at Simancas</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The troops of King <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ramiro-ii-of-leon">Ramiro II of León</a> met those of the Cordovan <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/caliphate">caliph</a> <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/abd-al-rahman-iii">Abd al-Rahman III</a> near the walls of Simancas, and Ramiro defeated the caliph's army. Abd al-Rahman had raised the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/emirate-of-cordoba">Emirate of Córdoba</a> to a caliphate in 929.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag tih-tag-profile" href="/empire/kingdom-of-leon">Kingdom of León</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-simancas">Simancas</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ramiro-ii-of-leon">Ramiro II</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/abd-al-rahman-iii">Abd al-Rahman III</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/abd-al-rahman-iii" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/abd-al-rahman-iii.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/august-5">5 August</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Abd al-Rahman III's army storms Zamora in the Battle of Alhandic</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/caliphate">Caliph</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cordoba">Córdoba</a>'s troops assaulted the walls of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zamora">Zamora</a>, held by men loyal to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ramiro-ii-of-leon">Ramiro II of León</a>. The fighting was so bloody that the moat filled with corpses before the caliph's army won and seized the city.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag tih-tag-profile" href="/empire/caliphate-of-cordoba">Caliphate of Córdoba</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/abd-al-rahman-iii">Abd al-Rahman III</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ramiro-ii-of-leon">Ramiro II of León</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zamora">Zamora</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/october-2">2 October</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Otto I crushes the rebels at the Battle of Andernach</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">At <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/andernach">Andernach</a> on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rhine">Rhine</a>, followers of King <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/otto-i">Otto I</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/germany">Germany</a> decisively defeated rebels led by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/eberhard-of-franconia">Eberhard of Franconia</a>, the brother of the late King Conrad I. The rebel leaders were killed, and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/franconia">Franconia</a> came directly under the crown.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/eberhard-of-franconia">Eberhard of Franconia</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-trans">Battle of Trans</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Trans was fought in 939 at Trans, near Dol in north-eastern Brittany, traditionally on 1 August.</p></div></li></ol></section>
